      title: Way of the Crusader
      description: 'Gain 1 holy seal per 4 seconds (max 3).

        Upon taking damage while below full HP, consume a seal to heal for 3% max HP.

        Blocking a hit heals for 3% max HP and does not consume a seal.

        When a seal is consumed, your next auto attack deals an additional 50% weapon
        damage as extra fire.

        Every time a burn is applied, the enemy is also shocked.'
